+# Dual-gate round 3 (slice 10 delta) — MERGED VERDICT: **FAIL**
+
+```yaml
+gate: P6 dual gate, DELTA scope (REVIEW-STANDARD §9) + explicit round-2 resolution check
+base: c4e8ab91
+head: 7f5a1b8c
